tart"},"slots":{"content":[]}}]}}],"schemaVersion":2},"id":"site-frame","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z"}]}],"content":[{"entries":[{"createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","id":"about-entry","modelId":"about-content","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"about-heading-field":"A studio built around useful clarity","about-intro-field":"Sample Studio helps small teams make steady progress when the shape of the work is still emerging.","about-markdown-field":"## Work made visible\n\nWe keep questions, decisions, and drafts close together so everyone can see how an idea becomes a result.\n\n## Deliberate momentum\n\nShort cycles create room to learn without losing direction."}},{"createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","id":"article-first-question","modelId":"journal-articles","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"article-body-field":"## Begin with purpose\n\nA clear question creates a boundary for exploration. It helps the team compare options and recognize when enough evidence exists to move forward.","article-date-field":"2026-08-05","article-heading-field":"Start with the question","article-intro-field":"Before choosing a format or feature, name the question the work must answer.","article-slug-field":"start-with-the-question"}},{"createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","id":"article-moving-parts","modelId":"journal-articles","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"article-body-field":"## Draw the relationships\n\nList the people, decisions, and dependencies that can change the path of the work. The map does not need to be polished; it needs to make the next conversation easier.","article-date-field":"2026-08-12","article-heading-field":"Map the moving parts","article-intro-field":"A lightweight map can reveal where timing, ownership, and information need attention.","article-slug-field":"map-the-moving-parts"}},{"createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","id":"article-small-loops","modelId":"journal-articles","schemaVersion":1,"updatedAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","values":{"article-body-field":"## Share something concrete\n\nA narrow draft gives collaborators a real choice to react to. Capture what changed, decide what remains open, and prepare the next useful slice.","article-date-field":"2026-08-19","article-heading-field":"Review in small loops","article-intro-field":"Small reviews turn abstract agreement into specific, timely feedback.","article-slug-field":"review-in-small-loops"}}],"id":"content-indexeddb","models":[{"createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","document":{"fields":[{"id":"about-heading-field","key":"heading","kind":"text","label":"Heading","required":true},{"id":"about-intro-field","key":"intro","kind":"long-text","label":"Introduction","required":true},{"id":"about-markdown-field","key":"markdown","kind":"markdown","label":"Body","required":true}],"id":"about-content","kind":"single","name":"About content","schemaVersion":1},"id":"about-content","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","document":{"fields":[{"id":"article-heading-field","key":"heading","kind":"text","label":"Heading","required":true},{"id":"article-intro-field","key":"intro","kind":"long-text","label":"Introduction","required":true},{"id":"article-date-field","key":"publishedOn","kind":"date","label":"Published on","required":true},{"id":"article-body-field","key":"body","kind":"markdown","label":"Body","required":true},{"id":"article-slug-field","key":"slug","kind":"slug","label":"Slug","required":true}],"id":"journal-articles","kind":"collection","name":"Journal articles","schemaVersion":1},"id":"journal-articles","updatedAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z"}]}],"mappings":[{"id":"mapping-indexeddb","records":[{"createdAt":"2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","document":{"bindings":[{"id":"about-heading-binding","sourceFieldId":"about-heading-field","target":{"nodeId":"about-heading","prop":"heading"},"transform":{"kind":"identity